The '''Rosetta Project''' is a collection of datasets and tools which are used to provide data regarding the [[Lua (API)|Lua]] files distributed in the form of the [[Visual Studio Code|VSCode]] extension [[Umbrella (modding)|Umbrella]],  of the [[LuaDocs]] and the [[Unofficial JavaDocs (Build 42)|JavaDocs]].

The following are provided:
* [[github:PZ-Umbrella/pz-lua-stubdata|PZ Lua Stubdata]] - a dataset of the Lua files of the game
* [[github:PZ-Umbrella/pz-rosetta-source|PZ Rosetta Source]] - a dataset of the Java files of the game
* [[github:PZ-Umbrella/torch-zomboid|Torch Zomboid]] - a Python application using [[Torch]] to generate the stub files for [[Umbrella (modding)|Umbrella]]

The datasets are written following the [[github:Rosetta-Docs|Rosetta Docs]] format.

